  "origins.neoorigins.wraith.name": "Ibinu",
  "origins.neoorigins.wraith.description": "Ẹ̀mí tó ń joró tó ń rìn gba ọ̀rọ̀ tó lágbára. Awọn ipele nipasẹ ọpọlọpọ awọn bulọọki ṣugbọn ko le kọja obsidian titi yoo fi de fọọmu giga rẹ. Iduroṣinṣin fọọmu ti ara n fa ebi gbẹ, ati pe imọlẹ oorun ṣan ẹran ara rẹ.",
  "power.neoorigins.wraith_phase.name": "Spectral Fọọmù",
  "power.neoorigins.wraith_phase.description": "Yipada: rin nipasẹ awọn bulọọki to lagbara. Lakoko ti o wa ninu ohun amorindun kan, fo larọwọto (fo = soke, yi lọ yi bọ = isalẹ). Obsidian, nkigbe obsidian, ati bedrock ṣe idiwọ ọna rẹ. Phasing drains ebi.",
  "power.neoorigins.wraith_water_breathing.name": "Aimi",
  "power.neoorigins.wraith_water_breathing.description": "Ko nilo lati simi. Le ye laelae labẹ omi.",
